  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "AIChatField (new): a chat UI that talks to a server-side AI agent. The field sends the user's message to the host's chat API and shows the reply (HTML) with streaming, progress text, stop, retry, a new-conversation button and copy. Design properties: Agent (which server-side agent answers, selected by name), DocumentFolder (a folder under the design project's Resources whose Markdown/text files are handed to the agent as business definitions), Height (0 = fill the available height), TimeoutSeconds, MaxInputRows, SendOnEnter (Enter sends when true; Ctrl+Enter always sends and Shift+Enter always inserts a newline) and OnReplyReceived (script called with the reply HTML). The reply area keeps a minimum height so an empty chat is still visible, and server-rendered SVG charts display inside the reply. The request/response types live in Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.AIChat (AIChatSendRequest / AIChatSendResponse / AIChatStatusResponse). The host needs Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.Server 0.10.0 for the server side. Requires Codeer.LowCode.Blazor 1.3.32 or later.",
